WEBVTT

00:00:00.460 --> 00:00:05.580
I joined the Shoulder to Shoulder group about four months ago and during this period I saw

00:00:05.580 --> 00:00:09.180
a significant improvement in my business and in my personal life.

00:00:09.180 --> 00:00:12.300
I have less stress because I know what to focus on.

00:00:12.300 --> 00:00:17.940
I have more time in between where I can really sit down and think about things because every

00:00:17.940 --> 00:00:23.220
week what we do is we sit together with an amazing group of like-minded entrepreneurs.

00:00:23.220 --> 00:00:27.740
We talk about our bottlenecks and the focus points for this week and we really go in

00:00:27.740 --> 00:00:28.740
depth.

00:00:28.740 --> 00:00:32.380
We are on a surface level but we also reach a problem behind the problem.

00:00:32.380 --> 00:00:36.620
So it's an amazing group of guys so if you're an entrepreneur looking for like-minded people

00:00:36.620 --> 00:00:39.860
who can really go in depth on your business then this is definitely for you.
